[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-11
TITLE: Preferred Contact Method
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL set a member's Preferred Contact Method to Email, Phone, or None.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The member chooses how other members should make contact. The choices are email, phone, or neither. A Preferred Contact Method of None shows another member both the Primary Email and the Primary Phone Number.
<<<
DERIVED: True
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12, GSSC5-34
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved

