[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-84
TITLE: Position View
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let a logged-in member view that member's own Position, and SHALL let a user moderator view a member's Position, including when Position is empty.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A member can see the Position held for that member. A user moderator can see Position on member accounts, including an empty Position. An administrator is a user moderator. The member's access to that member's own Position is viewing it.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-12
GSSC5-36
<<<
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-42
  ROLE: Refines
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-50
  ROLE: Refines

