[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-20
TITLE: Password Replacement
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL let a logged-in member replace that member's password.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A logged-in member has to be able to replace that member's password. The backend retains a hash of the password, and the password itself is not retained. This requirement does not define password recovery.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-50
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-161
TITLE: Password Recovery
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL enable password recovery through secure methods.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A member can recover a password through secure methods. This requirement does not define those methods.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-48
  ROLE: Refines

