[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-171
TITLE: Leadership List
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide a complete list of the leadership of the GSSC upon request, including each leader's name, Position, preferred contact, the type of that preferred contact, and Account Photo when one is stored.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller can request the leadership page's list. Leaders are the members whose Position is populated. The photo is that member's Account Photo when the account holds one. The type of the preferred contact is that member's Preferred Contact Method. Changes to a leader's name, Position, photo, and preferred contact are made through account management, and this list reflects those changes.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: >>>
GSSC5-12
GSSC5-36
<<<
