UID: GSSC-BHLR-114
TITLE: Stored Membership Status
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a member's Membership Status.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The member account holds the member's Membership Status. This requirement does not define the status values.
<<<
DERIVED: True
