- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-59
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-129
TITLE: Event Duration
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a duration for each event.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds how long the event lasts. This requirement does not define the units of that duration.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-59
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-130
TITLE: Event Location
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a location for each event.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event entry holds where the event occurs. This requirement does not define the parts of a location.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-59
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-131
TITLE: Event Page Reference
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store a reference from each event to the page data table entry that holds that event's details.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The event's description and name are that event's details, stored in the page data table.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-59
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-132
TITLE: Event Audience
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL store whether each event is public or members-only.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The flag records whether the event is available to the public or only to members.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-59
  ROLE: Refines

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-174
TITLE: Public Events
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide the public events upon request.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
A caller can request the public events directly. A public event is an event whose audience is public. This request is not an announcement request, and the announcement window does not limit it. Members-only events are outside this request.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-59
  ROLE: Refines

