STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL provide the stored events upon request from a logged-in member.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
An authenticated member can request the stored events directly, whether an event is public or members-only. This request is not an announcement request, and the announcement window does not limit it.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
