[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-164
TITLE: Page Change Log
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL keep a searchable log of changes made to pages.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Changes made to pages are kept in a log that can be searched. This requirement does not define which details of a change are stored, or how long the log is kept.
<<<
