UID: GSSC-BHLR-165
TITLE: Page Change Attribution
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL link each logged page change to the member who performed it.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Each change in the page change log is attributed to the member who made that change.
<<<
DERIVED: False
