REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-49
  ROLE: Refines

[[/SECTION]]

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: GSSC-BHLR-166
TITLE: Resource Mutex
STATEMENT: >>>
The GSSC Website Unified Backend SHALL maintain a mutex for modification of each resource.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
One user at a time modifies a given resource. Single-editor behavior for a public page or section, including a publication, is this mutex. Different resources can be modified at the same time. This requirement does not define how the mutex is enforced.
<<<
DERIVED: False
CHANGE_DRIVER: GSSC5-12
REVIEW_STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: GSSC-PIR-53
  ROLE: Refines

